flowchart LR
  accTitle: Holdings freshness pilot
  accDescr: A manual check reads Holdings status and source timestamps. A new incident produces one local report. Repeat observations are deduplicated. A healthy reading closes an open incident or leaves the log untouched.
  api["Read Holdings<br/>status and health"] --> times["Check availability<br/>and balance / price age"]
  times --> prior["Read prior<br/>incident state"]
  prior --> state{"Source state?"}
  state -->|Healthy| ok["No report"]
  state -->|New incident| log["One report per<br/>source and episode"]
  state -->|Same incident| same["Deduplicate<br/>by local state"]
  state -->|Recovered| close["Record<br/>recovery"]
